<title>LATVIA: C.BANK LAT FIX FOR NON-CONVERTIBLE CURRENCIES.</title>
<headline>C.BANK LAT FIX FOR NON-CONVERTIBLE CURRENCIES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Wednesday set</p>
<p>the following rates for the lat for non-convertible currencies,</p>
<p>valid from July 21 to July 27.</p>
<p>    Belarus rouble 1000    0.0213</p>
<p>    Kazahk tenge 1000	7.62</p>
<p>    Azerbaijan manat 1000  0.145</p>
<p>    Uzbek som		  0.0089</p>
<p>    Georgian lari	    0.459</p>
<p>    Armenian dram 1000     1.40</p>
<p>    Turkmen manat 1000     0.138</p>
<p>    Tajik rouble 1000	1.043</p>
<p>    Ukrainian hryvnia	0.310</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
